  "conversion": "Complete plants d/e, ignore display translations. Both LODs keep every leaf/twig/wood component; near retains folded leaf fans, far simplifies each toward two triangles. Simplify within each connected component, lock the lowest 5mm and every wood border vertex, also use LockBorder for wood; retain its original geometry if simplification removes/disconnects it or loses any locked border vertex. Normalize original height to 0.91m, small plant modestly widened. Official RGB16 alpha converted to 8-bit high bytes by Pillow, then unchanged; RGB-only transparent dilation. No normal/ARM runtime maps. Far silhouette and actual-game cost remain subject to visual/GPU validation.",
